Add the following Telit FN912 compositions:

0x3000: rmnet + tty (AT/NMEA) + tty (AT) + tty (diag)
T:  Bus=03 Lev=01 Prnt=03 Port=07 Cnt=01 Dev#=  8 Spd=480  MxCh= 0
